{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1088","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Ehab and subtraction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You're given an array $$$a$$$. You should repeat the following operation $$$k$$$ times: find the minimum non-zero element in the array, print it, and then subtract it from all the non-zero elements of the array. If all the elements are 0s, just print 0."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ $$$(1 \\le n,k \\le 10^5)$$$, the length of the array and the number of operations you should perform."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ space-separated integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ $$$(1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9)$$$, the elements of the array."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the minimum non-zero element before each operation in a new line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 5\n1 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n1\n1\n0\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 2\n10 3 5 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first step: the array is $$$[1,2,3]$$$, so the minimum non-zero element is 1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second step: the array is $$$[0,1,2]$$$, so the minimum non-zero element is 1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third step: the array is $$$[0,0,1]$$$, so the minimum non-zero element is 1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth and fifth step: the array is $$$[0,0,0]$$$, so we printed 0."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first step: the array is $$$[10,3,5,3]$$$, so the minimum non-zero element is 3."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second step: the array is $$$[7,0,2,0]$$$, so the minimum non-zero element is 2."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1088B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1088/problem/B"}